      "text": "[9:08PM] #Imota_Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nSabo Roundabout to Itamaga (via Alaka) is good movement in both directions.\nReturn journey from Itamaga to Sabo Roundabout (via Alaka) is good traffic flow.\n\nItamaga to Agbowa (via Lasustech, Lucky Fibre, Maya, Adamo, and Imota) is good traffic movement in both directions.\nItamaga Roundabout to Ijede (via Idi Iroko, Omitoro, Eleshin, and Elepe) is also good.\nElepe to Gberigbe (via AP) is good traffic movement.\n\nOfficers are on ground ensuring a smooth and safe traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
