      "text": "[9:37PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nAnthony Service Lane to Maryland intersection is smooth traffic flow.\nMaryland intersection to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is good traffic movement.\nMobolaji Bank Anthony Way is calm and smooth traffic flow.\n\nSeveral major roads in the area are experiencing free-flowing traffic, which are Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way and Ikeja G.R.A .\n\nOfficers are actively at various locations, effectively controlling traffic and ensuring a smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
