      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1943048980629258414",
      "text": "[9:41PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nAbule Ado to Iyana Iba (via under bridge, Volks, and Afolabi Ege) is smooth traffic movement.\n\nIyana Iba intersection is a bit busy due to commercial activities.\n\nIyana Iba to Igando (via First Gate, Iyana School, and Obadore Bridge) is good traffic flow.\nReturn journey to Iyana Iba is better movement.\n\nIyana Iba to Agbara (via Igbo Elerin junction, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era, and Custom checkpoint) is good traffic movement.\nIn and out of Igbo Elerin is okay.\n\nAfolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri road is good traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
