      "text": "[10:01PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement on Eko bridge by NEPA intersection inward Apongbon is looking good.\n\nDescending Eko bridge while ascending CMS bridge to connect CMS is good.\n\nDescending Eko bridge inward Elegbeta Mini stadium, Ebute-Ero market to connect Eko bridge is good.\n\nDescending from Carter bridge inward Ebute-Ero market, Leventis through UBA roundabout to connect inner and outer Marina is also good.\n\nGood movement on Broad street down to Apongbon underneath the bridge to connect Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo.\n\nGood  movement on CMS bridge inward Offin Canal market down to Ijora Olopa by NEPA intersection.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
